WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.408
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.408 --> 00:00:06.950
SPEAKER: Give me
one minute, and I'll

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.710
show you how Data Studio
can put your data to work,

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:13.100
giving you powerful exploration
and visualization tools to tell

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.700
stories with your data.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.030
You can think of Data Studio
as that all-in-one power

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.970
adapter that lets you charge
any device in your household.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.820
It can take an energy, which
you can think of as data,

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:26.480
and then use that energy to
power any device, like reports.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.640
Data Studio connects to
many different sources,

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:33.140
allowing you to quickly pull ads
data, SQL databases, BigQuery

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:36.260
tables and Sheets into its
processing and transformation

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:36.980
tools.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.650
A strong query language,
along with useful functions,

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.570
allows you to build
metrics and dimensions

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.367
for reporting and visualizing.

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:45.200
When you're ready to
share your conclusions,

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.890
Data Studio is ready with
you, with graphs charts,

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.550
pivot tables, shapes, dynamic
controls for customizing

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:53.630
all of your data.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.730
To get started quickly,
you can import data

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:00.530
from Google Ads, Analytics,
YouTube, BigQuery,

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:02.390
or just pull in a CSV or Sheet.

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:05.480
You can quickly invite others
to view or edit along with you

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:08.870
and embed the reports you make
inside websites, presentations,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.130
or blog posts.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.270
Google Data Studio is free.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.870
This levels the business
intelligence playing field,

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:17.150
all fueled by the
power of Google Cloud.

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.460
So go ahead, unite
all your data sources,

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.310
explore, and transform,
tell impactful stories

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.560
that help illuminate
trends, and next time you're

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.458
looking to do data analysis
for business intelligence,

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:29.000
take a minute to
look at Data Studio.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:35.210
To learn more, check out
datastudio.google.com.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:38.560
[MUSIC PLAYING]

